I come out of the fitting room.
There is a big mirror there.
Near the mirror is a beautiful dupatta.
This red dupatta is very attractive.
I touch the fabric.
This cotton fabric is very soft.
I often wear red clothes.
I look at the price of the dupatta.
The price is very low.
It is for only two hundred rupees.
I put the red dupatta on my shoulder.
I look in the big mirror.
It looks very good on me.
I go to the bhaiya.
I say, "Bhaiya, I want this red dupatta."
He says, "Yes madam, this colour is very beautiful."
I smile.
I buy this red dupatta too.
